{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of sizes semantic tokens to use for text area sizes"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"sizes","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProviderC5sizes0A8Contract015AllSizeSemanticgH0_pvp","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizes"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract29AllSizeSemanticTokensProviderP"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizes"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract29AllSizeSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetextareacomponenttokensprovider\/sizes"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetextareacomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component tokens of text area"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTextArea"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TextAreaComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"text area"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider":{"title":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allsizesemantictokensprovider","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of size"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider/sizes":{"abstract":[{"text":"Provider of sizes semantic tokens to use for text area sizes","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetextareacomponenttokensprovider\/sizes","kind":"symbol","title":"sizes","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"sizes","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract29AllSizeSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OU